WEBVTT

00:00:02.599 --> 00:00:09.791
Terry protested after Candy was locked up
in school's tower, but to no avail.

00:00:11.138 --> 00:00:18.640
Stear and Archie tried to reveal Eliza's plot,
but it too ended in failure.

00:00:20.076 --> 00:00:23.841
In that moment, Terry made a decision.

00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:31.568
Terry's decision.

00:00:34.019 --> 00:00:35.251
It's already morning...

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:39.132
I must have fallen asleep
listening to Terry's harmonica.

00:00:39.358 --> 00:00:40.460
Terry?

00:00:40.569 --> 00:00:41.741
Terry!

00:00:43.427 --> 00:00:46.126
Terry. He probably went back to his room.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.653
He stood here all night, playing the harmonica
to console me.

00:00:56.042 --> 00:00:56.762
Terry.

00:00:56.914 --> 00:00:58.236
Thank you so much!

00:00:58.743 --> 00:01:02.372
Because of you, I wasn't feeling lonely at all!

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:06.154
Kurin!

00:01:06.484 --> 00:01:09.051
Sorry, Kurin! Of course that it was
because of you, too!

00:01:19.141 --> 00:01:21.826
You snuck out of the school so early in the morning
in order to speak to me...

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.488
I didn't expect you to do such a thing
over such trivial matters.

00:01:26.128 --> 00:01:31.172
To you, Father, it may sound trivial,
but it's something extremely important to me!

00:01:31.402 --> 00:01:35.306
So that Candy-or-something girl...
you expect me to help her?

00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:37.665
Please, Father!

00:01:42.178 --> 00:01:44.385
You only call me Father at times like these.

00:01:44.914 --> 00:01:47.368
The school's methods are way too cruel!

00:01:47.945 --> 00:01:50.180
They expelled her without even trying
to find out the truth!

00:01:51.709 --> 00:01:52.893
Candy is innocent!

00:01:52.894 --> 00:01:54.026
Terrius!

00:01:55.164 --> 00:02:01.086
I've always tolerated your whims,
but this time, I won't.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.580
It's only reasonable that she was expelled.

00:02:03.971 --> 00:02:06.095
In that case, why wasn't I expelled?

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.616
Because I spoke up in your favor at the school.

00:02:10.917 --> 00:02:13.373
That's why I need your influence now!

00:02:13.451 --> 00:02:16.275
It was all my fault that Candy wound up like this!
Therefore...

00:02:16.426 --> 00:02:17.439
No!

00:02:17.872 --> 00:02:21.383
It looks like it's better that
this girl isn't near you.

00:02:22.025 --> 00:02:25.941
Are you saying that you won't
help her, Father?

00:02:26.227 --> 00:02:27.474
Exactly.

00:02:32.825 --> 00:02:35.793
I knew it... I shouldn't have come here.

00:02:36.217 --> 00:02:37.904
I knew it would've ended up like this.

00:02:40.534 --> 00:02:41.796
But what if...

00:02:41.973 --> 00:02:44.917
...what if I ask them...

00:02:49.412 --> 00:02:50.412
Father.

00:02:51.672 --> 00:02:57.705
Father, I had no right to come here and
trouble you with my own issues.

00:02:59.308 --> 00:03:03.728
However, whatever happens from now on,
I won't go around with my head bowed down!

00:03:04.091 --> 00:03:06.029
I will resolve everything on my own!

00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:08.704
Terrius!

00:03:28.522 --> 00:03:30.917
Today's mass was different, wasn't it?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:34.248
Sisters are probably concerned over Candy and Terrius.

00:03:34.283 --> 00:03:37.463
But dating in the barn...
That's quite something!

00:03:37.497 --> 00:03:39.633
-They've got some guts!
-Really!

00:03:39.668 --> 00:03:41.614
But that Candy is a filthy one...

00:03:41.792 --> 00:03:43.843
Everybody is talking about Candy.

00:03:43.878 --> 00:03:46.606
Because it's the first
scandal in history of this school.

00:03:46.969 --> 00:03:49.005
No wonder she got expelled!

00:03:50.076 --> 00:03:51.147
Eliza.

00:03:53.095 --> 00:03:53.896
Terry!

00:03:53.931 --> 00:03:55.035
He's coming this way.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.091
Terry.

00:04:03.052 --> 00:04:04.533
Terry, I...

00:04:09.595 --> 00:04:11.056
What a guy!

00:04:11.611 --> 00:04:12.652
Are you alright, Eliza?

00:04:12.831 --> 00:04:14.231
Go away!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.213
Come in.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:32.057
Terrius!

00:04:33.808 --> 00:04:36.078
Sister Gray, I'm here to speak to you.

00:04:36.422 --> 00:04:39.486
Don't you realize that you're
confined to your room?

00:04:42.121 --> 00:04:43.768
Just give me a few moments.

00:04:43.808 --> 00:04:46.096
I won't. Get out immediately!

00:04:47.111 --> 00:04:51.873
Sister Gray! This is my first and last request!
It will only take a minute!

00:04:56.792 --> 00:04:58.986
I've never seen him like this.

00:05:01.728 --> 00:05:02.510
Very well.

00:05:02.683 --> 00:05:05.282
I'll give you a special permit.
I'm expecting you to be brief.

00:05:05.283 --> 00:05:06.260
Thank you.

00:05:06.638 --> 00:05:07.911
What do you want to talk about?

00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:09.242
Sister Gray,

00:05:10.406 --> 00:05:12.966
miss Candice's expulsion is irreversible?

00:05:13.311 --> 00:05:15.218
You're still dwelling on that?

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:17.866
I am not going to change my mind.

00:05:18.279 --> 00:05:22.537
I can't have both of you in the same
school after you caused such an incident!

00:05:23.023 --> 00:05:26.089
In that case, I want to be expelled instead of her!

00:05:27.923 --> 00:05:30.389
Since you're saying that it is good
that the two of us aren't in the same school,

00:05:30.554 --> 00:05:31.653
...I will be the one to leave!

00:05:33.079 --> 00:05:35.232
Are you serious?

00:05:36.145 --> 00:05:37.156
I am serious.

00:05:40.134 --> 00:05:41.322
I can't allow that.

00:05:41.357 --> 00:05:43.836
Firstly, what would Duke Grandchester
say about it?

00:05:44.236 --> 00:05:45.693
He did not object.

00:05:46.395 --> 00:05:47.270
What?

00:05:49.265 --> 00:05:51.766
He had no objections, sister Gray.

00:05:52.319 --> 00:05:54.598
From today, I am renouncing my Grandchester name.

00:05:55.267 --> 00:05:56.217
What?!

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.328
Excuse me.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.129
Wait, Terrius!

00:06:03.559 --> 00:06:05.412
Farewell, sister Gray.

00:06:10.088 --> 00:06:11.193
Terrius...

00:06:23.632 --> 00:06:24.764
Terry!

00:06:29.292 --> 00:06:36.270
This hill looks exactly like my Pony's hill!
That's why I'm calling it "Other Pony's hill!"

00:06:38.332 --> 00:06:39.949
Freckled Tarzan.

00:06:41.789 --> 00:06:45.872
What, Freckled Tarzan? You're so rude!

00:07:11.482 --> 00:07:12.628
It's better this way.

00:07:13.138 --> 00:07:16.432
I won't be able to come to this hill
and see Candy anymore.

00:07:17.858 --> 00:07:20.092
If I'm going, I'd better leave quickly.

00:07:24.046 --> 00:07:27.240
Brother, the class is going to begin
if you don't hurry!

00:07:27.502 --> 00:07:28.864
I'll be done in a moment.

00:07:30.119 --> 00:07:31.144
Terry!

00:07:31.169 --> 00:07:32.407
Hi, Terry!

00:07:33.162 --> 00:07:35.915
Would you care to take a look at my newest invention?

00:07:36.485 --> 00:07:37.447
What is it?

00:07:38.009 --> 00:07:39.177
It's a lie detector.

00:07:39.484 --> 00:07:43.578
My brother stayed up all night building this thing
so he could help Candy!

00:07:44.371 --> 00:07:46.621
This thing will reveal Eliza's plot.

00:07:49.645 --> 00:07:51.796
-Brother, let's go!
-Okay.

00:07:51.825 --> 00:07:53.260
Terry, won't you come with us?

00:07:56.538 --> 00:07:57.702
What's the matter?

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.685
I thought about how much I owe you.

00:08:01.103 --> 00:08:03.405
I know I won't have to worry about Candy.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:07.943
You got that right.

00:08:10.484 --> 00:08:13.520
Your hands are soft.
Perfect for working with mechanics.

00:08:14.595 --> 00:08:17.611
Say, maybe we could cooperate together?

00:08:18.254 --> 00:08:19.569
Someday, for sure.

00:08:22.123 --> 00:08:23.121
Bye.

00:08:24.277 --> 00:08:27.591
What's going on with him?
He's not his usual self.

00:08:36.616 --> 00:08:38.373
My youth is passing.

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:41.485
My love is coming to an end.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.648
Farewell, Candy.

00:09:00.129 --> 00:09:02.111
I wish they'd bring me something to eat!

00:09:02.511 --> 00:09:06.840
Cinnamon eggs, apple pie and
chocolate drink...

00:09:09.022 --> 00:09:12.082
Oh, I did it again!
It won't get any more luxurious than this!

00:09:13.724 --> 00:09:14.737
Candice!

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.582
-Candice!
-Yes!

00:09:17.907 --> 00:09:19.329
Are you alright?

00:09:19.689 --> 00:09:20.804
I'll open now.

00:09:21.169 --> 00:09:25.439
Sister Margaret brought me some food.
Hide quickly!

00:09:31.006 --> 00:09:33.471
Good morning, sister Margaret!

00:09:33.683 --> 00:09:35.465
Are you feeling alright, Candice?

00:09:36.127 --> 00:09:39.152
My stomach is growling!
No, uh...

00:09:40.077 --> 00:09:41.376
Say, the food...

00:09:41.457 --> 00:09:43.863
Come. You're getting out.

00:09:45.104 --> 00:09:46.831
Sister Gray wants to see you.

00:09:47.107 --> 00:09:50.629
Then, this means that someone from the
Adley family came to pick me up?

00:09:51.612 --> 00:09:53.828
I don't know any details.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.330
But, Candice...

00:09:55.645 --> 00:09:56.351
Yes?

00:09:56.441 --> 00:09:59.557
Whatever happens,
don't let yourself be crushed.

00:10:00.764 --> 00:10:02.024
Thank you!

00:10:02.182 --> 00:10:04.021
-Now, come.
-Yes!

00:10:07.879 --> 00:10:12.478
Sister Margaret, I won't forget about you
when I get out of this school.

00:10:13.745 --> 00:10:15.259
Now, let's go.

00:10:20.276 --> 00:10:21.374
Kurin?

00:10:21.808 --> 00:10:23.224
Let's hurry.

00:10:23.797 --> 00:10:24.860
Yes.

00:10:38.825 --> 00:10:41.497
*Denjin Anime Fansub*

00:10:43.433 --> 00:10:46.669
Sister Gray, I brought Candice White Adley.

00:10:46.916 --> 00:10:48.187
Thank you.

00:10:49.466 --> 00:10:51.012
-Go.
-Yes.

00:10:54.569 --> 00:10:56.209
Candice, come here.

00:10:56.585 --> 00:10:57.618
Yes!

00:11:00.612 --> 00:11:02.760
-Candice.
-Yes!

00:11:03.305 --> 00:11:04.837
I have changed the measures against you;

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:10.852
...instead of special expulsion, your punishment
will be changed to a week of room confinement,

00:11:12.762 --> 00:11:15.818
...so that you could thoroughly
reflect upon your actions.

00:11:15.995 --> 00:11:17.218
Is this for real?

00:11:17.318 --> 00:11:18.595
You can step down.

00:11:19.145 --> 00:11:21.571
Thank you so much, sister Gray!

00:11:21.911 --> 00:11:24.499
Sister Gray, just one thing...

00:11:24.726 --> 00:11:26.156
I'd like you to understand this,

00:11:26.508 --> 00:11:29.615
After receiving those notes, both of us
went to the barn without thinking.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.508
But Terry and I...

00:11:31.543 --> 00:11:32.519
Step down!

00:11:34.054 --> 00:11:34.977
Yes.

00:11:35.199 --> 00:11:36.433
Sister Gray.

00:11:55.141 --> 00:11:59.482
Terrius and Candice are saying the exact same thing.
Maybe it really was a trap.

00:12:00.237 --> 00:12:04.790
But their meeting in the barn has become
a hottest topic of discussion in school.

00:12:05.455 --> 00:12:09.930
If I allowed both of them to stay in this school,
other students could have started doing the same.

00:12:10.753 --> 00:12:12.233
Having said that...

00:12:20.819 --> 00:12:22.708
Freedom is the best!

00:12:29.619 --> 00:12:33.701
But why have they revoked
my punishment so suddenly?

00:12:34.761 --> 00:12:36.644
Maybe Terry had something to do with this.

00:12:42.248 --> 00:12:44.439
-Eliza! It's an emergency!
-What happened?

00:12:44.893 --> 00:12:48.742
Candy's punishment was reduced
from expulsion to a room confinement!

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.541
Impossible!

00:12:53.354 --> 00:12:54.370
Patty!

00:12:55.501 --> 00:12:57.515
Why did Candy...

00:12:57.713 --> 00:12:59.173
Somebody is standing behind this.

00:12:59.342 --> 00:13:02.106
Otherwise this would have never happened!

00:13:02.301 --> 00:13:04.554
That's right. Something is strange.

00:13:05.547 --> 00:13:06.564
Terrius.

00:13:06.959 --> 00:13:08.258
It's Terrius!

00:13:09.049 --> 00:13:14.375
Terrius had his father, Duke Grandchester
make pressure on the school board!

00:13:15.316 --> 00:13:16.476
That must be it!

00:13:16.651 --> 00:13:18.366
He has the power to do that!

00:13:18.768 --> 00:13:19.963
Be quiet!

00:13:22.009 --> 00:13:25.544
Eliza, stop talking about things
that are beyond your knowledge.

00:13:26.063 --> 00:13:29.029
Then, why was Candy's punishment reduced?

00:13:30.307 --> 00:13:33.401
Say it frankly!
Every one of us wants to know what happened!

00:13:35.509 --> 00:13:38.602
This incident was the first scandal
in history of this school.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.860
Towards that end, we must manage
such matters with discretion.

00:13:43.491 --> 00:13:47.990
We have found a better solution,
both for those two and for the school.

00:13:48.176 --> 00:13:49.311
This is most important.

00:13:49.369 --> 00:13:53.652
Are you saying that reducing Candy's
punishment was the best solution?

00:13:55.182 --> 00:13:58.182
Those measures seemed the best to me!

00:13:58.845 --> 00:14:02.290
-That strict nun has become this meek?
-Yes, it's strange.

00:14:02.546 --> 00:14:06.382
-She became soft all of a sudden.
-What's going on?

00:14:06.718 --> 00:14:08.023
Be quiet!

00:14:08.242 --> 00:14:09.302
Quiet!

00:14:12.081 --> 00:14:16.169
Today is time for Director to
hold her special lecture.

00:14:16.771 --> 00:14:19.123
Today we'll be studying...

00:14:19.158 --> 00:14:22.195
Students haven't caught on to the truth.

00:14:23.207 --> 00:14:25.636
But they will eventually find out
what happened to Terrius.

00:14:25.841 --> 00:14:30.910
When that happens, am I going to regret
allowing Candice to stay in this school?

00:14:40.951 --> 00:14:44.116
It's already night!

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:55.524
Huh? There is no light in Terry's room.

00:14:55.817 --> 00:14:57.034
What happened?

00:15:01.059 --> 00:15:02.127
Alright!

00:15:17.559 --> 00:15:18.559
Terry?

00:15:18.911 --> 00:15:21.771
Terry, I was worried about you.

00:15:23.287 --> 00:15:24.555
Terry!

00:15:32.995 --> 00:15:35.000
Everything is put in order.

00:15:40.494 --> 00:15:41.647
A letter?

00:15:50.246 --> 00:15:51.763
To the thoughtful finder;

00:15:51.798 --> 00:15:55.279
Give this letter to miss Candice White Adley.
Terrius.

00:15:56.911 --> 00:15:58.126
Terrius!

00:16:02.063 --> 00:16:05.995
Candy. I decided to quit school
and go to America.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.731
There is something I'd like to do.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.042
Wherever I might end up,
I'll be praying for your happiness.

00:16:10.199 --> 00:16:11.288
Terrius.

00:16:11.296 --> 00:16:14.503
Wherever I might end up,
I'll be praying for your happiness.

00:16:15.036 --> 00:16:16.499
Wherever...?

00:16:19.782 --> 00:16:21.985
Terry... went to America.

00:16:25.836 --> 00:16:28.492
Terry... what an easygoing letter.

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.946
Almost too easygoing, Terry.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.843
How could you...

00:16:33.465 --> 00:16:35.429
How could you leave like this?

00:16:41.628 --> 00:16:45.934
Candice, instead of special expulsion,
you will be confined to your room.

00:16:46.554 --> 00:16:50.038
Come to think of it, they forgave
me too easily.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:55.829
Special expulsion... don't tell me
that Terry did this for me...

00:16:56.502 --> 00:16:57.698
I'm sure he did.

00:17:05.278 --> 00:17:07.526
He played his harmonica all night long for me.

00:17:08.677 --> 00:17:10.735
But he was trying to say goodbye.

00:17:13.824 --> 00:17:16.386
I heard that Terry was expelled from this place!

00:17:17.445 --> 00:17:18.540
It's Neil!

00:17:18.575 --> 00:17:21.803
-For the better!
-He was a weird one.

00:17:21.994 --> 00:17:23.518
Hey, it's his room!

00:17:23.553 --> 00:17:27.002
He allowed himself to get expelled
instead of that dogsbody.

00:17:28.249 --> 00:17:29.180
Neil!

00:17:30.526 --> 00:17:32.146
Hi, Stear and Archie.

00:17:32.337 --> 00:17:34.016
Is it true what you said now?

00:17:34.163 --> 00:17:35.137
Let go of me!

00:17:36.229 --> 00:17:38.359
You said that Terry left instead of Candy!

00:17:38.537 --> 00:17:39.606
It's true!

00:17:40.672 --> 00:17:45.186
That's right, sisters were talking about
it and we overheard them. It's true.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.707
Brother...

00:17:48.866 --> 00:17:51.233
So back then, he was bidding us farewell...

00:17:52.465 --> 00:17:53.830
So that's what it was.

00:17:54.844 --> 00:17:56.616
And where did Terry go?

00:17:56.824 --> 00:18:00.208
To America. He said that he would be leaving
by morning ship.

00:18:00.384 --> 00:18:01.297
Let's go.

00:18:03.474 --> 00:18:05.590
-To America?
-By morning ship?

00:18:06.486 --> 00:18:08.143
He left so I wouldn't have to...

00:18:10.797 --> 00:18:12.080
So quickly...

00:18:12.514 --> 00:18:14.634
Parting from him so quickly...

00:18:15.784 --> 00:18:16.563
...no!

00:18:16.731 --> 00:18:17.915
No!

00:18:18.079 --> 00:18:19.687
I don't want to part from you!

00:18:21.467 --> 00:18:22.607
No!!!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.062
I turned up late.

00:19:50.154 --> 00:19:52.020
I couldn't see him.

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:02.834
Terry... I... I...

00:20:03.184 --> 00:20:04.511
I love you!

00:20:06.249 --> 00:20:09.760
Candy, wherever I might end up,
I'll be praying for your happiness.

00:20:10.074 --> 00:20:14.254
TERRY!!!

00:20:25.713 --> 00:20:26.895
Just my imagination.

00:20:27.108 --> 00:20:30.821
I must be imagining it since
we first met on such a ship.

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.929
The shore is already far...

00:20:33.423 --> 00:20:34.837
Candy, stay happy!

00:20:35.024 --> 00:20:37.380
But someday... someday, for sure!

00:20:51.207 --> 00:20:53.790
Terry... what should I do?

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:55.494
What should I do now?

00:20:55.938 --> 00:20:59.473
Did you think that staying here
would've brought me happiness?

00:20:59.682 --> 00:21:00.624
Terry!

00:21:01.485 --> 00:21:02.985
Terry!

00:21:06.537 --> 00:21:09.084
While this painful parting was taking place,

00:21:09.389 --> 00:21:18.472
Candy thought how it would've been better
if she was the one to have been expelled from school.

00:21:18.627 --> 00:21:20.040
To be continued.
